# Meta Muse / Meta AI - Surge external ruleset (no policy column)
# Collected: 2026-11-15
# DOMAIN-SUFFIX also covers API, WebSocket, and other subdomains.
#
# Official entry point:
# https://about.fb.com/news/2026/09/introducing-muse-personal-ai-agent/
# https://muse.ai/
#
# GitHub domain evidence:
# https://github.com/Tartarus2014/Loon-Script/blob/1554bb62412e54a26bf27e7d78a1fb09c4885381/Rule/Other/Muse.lsr
